    "summary": "On the 200 held-out Mirefield levels, Skua did not significantly differ from Plover-PG in mean normalized return (primary endpoint): paired t-test t=1.18, p=0.27, 95% CI [-0.84, 2.66] for the mean paired difference (Skua − Plover-PG).",
